WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.340
There are few things more annoying than typing during a visit.

2
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:08.480
With Quickler, you can send a voice note, just like you would to a friend.

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.640
Quickler transcribes any accent

4
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:14.300
and puts each thing you said on the right question in your report.
